MapIntro:01
"Welcome to Puzzler's League of Lords!"
End

MapIntro:02
"First, buy a hero from this expansion pad \n For now, you can only buy one"
End

MapIntro:03
"Now buy a unit from the forbidden pool"
End

MapIntro:04
"Garrison the unit in the tower so that it spawns on the map"
End

MapIntro:05
"You can sell the units back at the forbidden pool when you are done with them"
End

MapIntro:06
"Win your victory by destroying the other team's fort!"
End

SpawningActivation
