End

ArcherLimitOn
"Ring Heroes mode is on so the archer limit is in effect"
End

ArcherLimitOff
"Ring Heroes mode is off so the archer limit is not in effect"
End

Level2
"A player has upgraded their pool to level 2! \n All players may now own 2 heroes."
End

Level3
"A player has upgraded their pool to level 3! \n All players may now own 3 heroes."
End

Level4
"A player has upgraded their pool to level 4! \n All players may now own 4 heroes."
End

NearlyDead
"A fort is nearly destroyed!"
End

